---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="About" description="Steve Urmston, AI product engineer in York, UK: designer, engineer and product manager since 2003, now building AI products.">
  <article class="wrap page">
    <figure class="portrait">
      <picture>
        <source media="(min-width: 761px)" srcset="/assets/images/steve-urmston.jpg" />
        <img src="/assets/images/steve-urmston.landscape.jpg" alt="Steve Urmston, smiling, at a riverside table" width="720" height="860" />
      </picture>
    </figure>

    <div class="body">
      <h1>
        I
        <span class="heart">
          <span class="visually-hidden">heart</span>
          <svg viewBox="2 2.9 20 18.5" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M12 21.4 10.6 20.1C5.4 15.4 2 12.3 2 8.4 2 5.3 4.4 2.9 7.5 2.9c1.7 0 3.4.8 4.5 2.1 1.1-1.3 2.8-2.1 4.5-2.1 3.1 0 5.5 2.4 5.5 5.5 0 3.9-3.4 7-8.6 11.7z" />
          </svg>
        </span>
        product
      </h1>

      <div class="copy">
        <p>
          Hi, I’m Steve. I started my own web design business in 2003, straight out of university. After that came seven years at a York agency, and an MSc in Human-Centred Interactive Technologies.
        </p>
        <p>
          Since then I’ve worked as a UX developer, a product manager and a lead frontend engineer. Building AI products uses all of it: what people need, the interface they use, and the evals that show it works.
        </p>
        <p>
          I live in York with my wife and our two boys. I make furniture with hand tools. I play football, golf and padel, and the mental side of sport interests me as much as the playing.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .page {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 5fr) minmax(0, 7fr);
    gap: clamp(40px, 6vw, 96px);
    align-items: center;
    padding-block: clamp(56px, 8vw, 96px) 0;
  }

  .portrait {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .portrait img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    aspect-ratio: 720 / 860;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: var(--surface);
  }

  .body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 28px;
    max-width: 34em;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(32px, 4.4vw, 50px);
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
  }

  /* Lub-dub a few times on arrival, then rest; beats again on hover */
  .heart svg {
    display: inline-block;
    /* Lowercase height, so it reads as part of the line rather than a capital */
    width: 0.584em;
    height: 0.54em;
    margin-inline: 0.2em;
    vertical-align: 0.02em;
    /* The viewBox is cropped to the shape, so let anti-aliased edges spill over */
    overflow: visible;
    fill: var(--orange);
    transform-origin: 50% 55%;
    animation: beat 1.6s ease-in-out 0.8s 3;
  }

  h1:hover .heart svg {
    animation-iteration-count: infinite;
  }

  @keyframes beat {
    0%, 40%, 100% { transform: scale(1); }
    12% { transform: scale(1.1); }
    22% { transform: scale(0.98); }
    30% { transform: scale(1.06); }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .heart svg {
      animation: none;
    }
  }

  .copy {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1em;
    font-size: clamp(17px, 1.5vw, 19px);
    line-height: 1.6;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .page {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 32px;
    }

    .portrait img {
      aspect-ratio: 720 / 320;
    }
  }
</style>
